  <%# =========================================================================
      11. RAILS 8.1 — ACTIVE JOB CONTINUATIONS
      ========================================================================= %>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>🔄 Active Job Continuations <span class="badge badge-purple">✨ Rails 8.1</span></h3>
    <p class="subtitle">Resumable multi-step jobs — survive deploys & restarts without losing progress</p>

    <div class="stat-row">
      <span class="stat-label">Total imports</span>
